WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.050
An authorized employee locks
out a machine and services it.

2
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:07.276
Only trained, authorized
employees apply locks.

3
00:00:07.276 --> 00:00:11.326
An affected employee runs the
machine or works in the area.

4
00:00:11.326 --> 00:00:16.063
They must recognize a lockout and
never restart locked-out equipment.

5
00:00:16.063 --> 00:00:18.122
If your job means reaching in,

6
00:00:18.122 --> 00:00:20.319
like clearing a jam or cleaning,

7
00:00:20.319 --> 00:00:23.957
you must be trained as
authorized and lock out first.

8
00:00:23.957 --> 00:00:27.115
Everyone else must respect
every lock and tag.
